          "raw": "Hello,\n\nThis is an automated message from Discourse to let you know that your account has been temporarily placed on hold as a precautionary measure.\n\nPlease do continue to browse, but you won't be able to reply or create topics until a [staff member](http://localhost:3051/about) reviews your most recent posts. We apologize for the inconvenience.\n\nFor additional guidance, refer to our [community guidelines](http://localhost:3051/guidelines).",
